{'symbol': 'KR', 'date': '2022-10-04 10:25:00', 'title': "KROGER SHARES AMERICA'S FAVORITE CANDIES AHEAD OF HALLOWEEN", 'text': "GROCER PROJECTS TOP-SELLING CANDIES AND REVEALS THE MOST-LOVED CANDY BAG CINCINNATI , OCT. 4, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE KROGER CO. (NYSE: KR), AMERICA'S LARGEST GROCERY RETAILER, TODAY SHARED AMERICA'S FAVORITE CANDIES HEADING INTO THE HALLOWEEN SEASON. THE GROCER, WHO SELLS MILLIONS OF POUNDS OF CANDY EACH YEAR, REVEALED THAT IT EXPECTS SHOPPERS WILL AGAIN REACH FOR HERSHEY'S REESE'S PEANUT BUTTER CUPS TO FILL THEIR BASKETS MORE THAN ANY OTHER CANDY THIS HALLOWEEN."}